  m_text: 'Weapons fire increases your signature, which is denoted by the number
    in the bottom left corner. The higher your signature, the easier you are to be
    targeted. Enemies targeting you will draw a purple line towards your ship, when
    the line becomes a solid red they can use missiles against you.


    Keeping
    your ship aimed towards the target will boost the speed and tracking of your
    guided munitions.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 52e6ae2838f9ff44dbd15175a7f87939, type: 2}
